 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《零境·入侵》是一款3D卡渲风格的横版动作肉鸽游戏。超炫酷动作，超爽快战斗，超自由构筑组合，丰富的交互内容与沉浸的剧情设计。让你在这个别具特色的赛博朋克世界中，战斗，变强，收集，再战斗，不断找寻世界的真相！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/50cb40169377ac934d796bcef96baad6.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富的基础动作与富有深度的动作组合，极具特色的空中连招。在横版多层级的地图中，体验跑酷式流畅丝滑的动作操作！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/b042df967a7da630318be2852719de49.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >细致的战斗反馈，多样的关卡设计，空战与地面战无缝切换，让每一场战斗都充满变化与挑战。在这里，你不仅要发挥动作技巧，更要运用战斗策略，打败敌人，赢取胜利！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/0f4eb5e7a22e8f041344ded46f7054a5.webp?t=1788488817\" width=440 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >切换不同时间骇客，选择不同战斗偏好。不管是近身战斗，还是远程射击，抑或攻防兼备，你都将找到适合你的战斗风格。在不同的角色中体会不一样的战斗，探寻每个角色背后的个性故事。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/9d3b10b31430429761e4547d5e64cc55.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >局内外多种系统自由搭配，打造独属于你的战斗构筑。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在每一次冒险中定制成长路径，获取局内效果。权能恩赐提供上百种增益；时空残片带来超强的全局影响；升格芯片改变角色操作模式！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在营地点亮各种局外养成系统，获得永久加成。属性提升、双重恩赐、重随机会……还能将构筑预设带入局中！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/792d66f1780c4a25b12a1d8c7031ba98.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/65226d647a08323db23cffca93870058.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >时间线崩塌，“虚世之主”耶罗索降临并将所有时间线推向毁灭。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >而你，时间骇客，将肩负起拯救世界的责任。在神秘之声“银”的引导下，得到更强的力量，找寻零号时间线，揪出耶罗索，战胜他，拯救世界！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/3531f4e94f48844a745bfa65ba1678e4.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《零境·入侵》是一款3D卡渲风格的横版动作肉鸽游戏。超炫酷动作，超爽快战斗，超自由构筑组合，丰富的交互内容与沉浸的剧情设计。让你在这个别具特色的赛博朋克世界中，战斗，变强，收集，再战斗，不断找寻世界的真相！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/50cb40169377ac934d796bcef96baad6.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >丰富的基础动作与富有深度的动作组合，极具特色的空中连招。在横版多层级的地图中，体验跑酷式流畅丝滑的动作操作！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.webm?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/d47e86e8fc35b81750616c8d23ea1e05.mp4?t=1788488817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/b042df967a7da630318be2852719de49.webp?t=1788488817\" width=353 height=50 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >细致的战斗反馈，多样的关卡设计，空战与地面战无缝切换，让每一场战斗都充满变化与挑战。在这里，你不仅要发挥动作技巧，更要运用战斗策略，打败敌人，赢取胜利！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.poster.avif?t=1788488817\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061170/extras/802e5379dc6f497fa77ef1303840c90c.webm?t=1788